<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="None" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>Justin Payne</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div><p>You left me shattered on a Sunday night</p><p>Words still echo under neon light</p><p>I gave you love 'til I lost my face</p><p>Kept showing up, just to be replaced</p></div><div><p>Now I’m picking up the parts you dropped</p><p>Turning every scar into something I got</p><p>I’m not broken, I’m just more real</p><p>A little more raw, but I know how to heal</p></div><div><p>I’m better in pieces than whole for you</p><p>Stronger in silence than begging for proof</p><p>You took the best, but I kept the flame</p><p>Now I rise from the wreck not wearing your name</p></div><div><p>I don’t miss the highs that came with pain</p><p>I don’t miss the love that felt like chains</p><p>I found my power in what we lacked</p><p>Took your goodbye, never looked back</p></div><div><p>You lost a heart that would’ve died for you</p><p>Now I’m someone you can’t run to</p><p>I broke, I bled, I found my peace</p><p>And baby, I love her she looks like me</p></div><div><p>I’m better in pieces than whole for you</p><p>Stronger in silence than begging for proof</p><p>You took the best, but I kept the flame</p><p>Now I rise from the wreck not wearing your name</p></div><div><p>I’m better in pieces than whole for you</p><p>Stronger in silence than begging for proof</p><p>You took the best, but I kept the flame</p><p>Now I rise from the wreck not wearing your name</p></div></body></tt>